            </note>
            <note corresp="#d324-f3" n="3" xml:id="d324-f3-content">
                <p>West German Chancellor Willy Brandt visited Washington April 7–11.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d324-f4" n="4" xml:id="d324-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d141">Document 141</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d324-f5" n="5" xml:id="d324-f5-content">
                <p>A handwritten note by Haldeman at the bottom of the page reads: “K—This arrived
                    for the Pres—<hi rendition="#italic">after</hi> Brandt had departed. H”.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
